<font face="Segoe UI" size="75">{\an8}Nagisa-chan!</font>

19
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:55,360
<font face="Segoe UI" size="75">Nagisa!</font>

20
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,450
<font face="Segoe UI" size="75">{\an8}Nagisa-chan?</font>

21
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,160
<font face="Segoe UI" size="75">Nagisa?!</font>

22
00:00:57,450 --> 00:00:59,160
<font face="Segoe UI" size="75">Nagisa, cậu sao thế?!</font>

23
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:00,030
<font face="Segoe UI" size="75">Nagisa!</font>

24
